    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Table&nbsp;7.01</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Summary of the main features of Beckwith&ndash;Wiedemann spectrum</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Section authors",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 467pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"623\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 188.5pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"251\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Feature</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.5pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Syndrome characteristics</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 188.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"251\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Syndrome MIM number(s)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">130650</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 188.5pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"251\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Associated malignant tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.5pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Nephroblastoma, hepatoblastoma, neuroblastoma, adrenal cortical carcinoma (rarely leukaemia, haemangioma, pancreatoblastoma, phaeochromocytoma, rhabdomyosarcoma)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 188.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"251\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Associated benign features</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Macroglossia, exomphalos, lateralized overgrowth, hyperinsulinism (lasting &gt;&nbsp;1 week and requiring escalated treatment)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pathology findings: adrenal cortex cytomegaly, placental mesenchymal dysplasia, or endocrine cell hyperplasia of the pancreas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 188.5pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"251\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.5pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Autosomal dominant (only 10&ndash;15% inherited)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 188.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"251\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Chromosome location</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">H19</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (11p15.5)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">IGF2</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (11p15.5)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">KCNQ1OT1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (11p15.5)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CDKN1C</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (11p15.4)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 188.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"251\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Inappropriate overexpression of <em>IGF2</em></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Loss of expression of the <em>CDKN1C</em> maternal allele (cell-cycle, cell-division, and growth regulator)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
