    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 460.7pt; background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"614\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The clinical diagnosis is based on a clinical scoring system (see below). For a clinical diagnosis of classic BWS, a patient requires a score of &ge;&nbsp;4. A score of &ge;&nbsp;2 merits BWS molecular testing <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{29377879;32430359}</span>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cardinal features (2 points per feature):</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Macroglossia</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Exomphalos</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lateralized overgrowth</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Multifocal and/or bilateral Wilms tumour or nephroblastomatosis</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hyperinsulinism (lasting &gt;&nbsp;1 week and requiring escalated treatment)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pathology findings: adrenal cortex cytomegaly, placental mesenchymal dysplasia, or endocrine cell hyperplasia of the pancreas (previously termed &ldquo;pancreatic adenomatosis&rdquo;)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Suggestive features (1 point per feature):</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Birthweight &gt;&nbsp;2 standard deviations above the mean</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Facial naevus simplex</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Polyhydramnios and/or placentomegaly</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Ear creases and/or pits</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Transient hypoglycaemia (lasting &lt;&nbsp;1 week)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Typical BWS tumours (neuroblastoma, rhabdomyosarcoma, unilateral Wilms tumour, hepatoblastoma, adrenocortical carcinoma, or phaeochromocytoma)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Nephromegaly and/or hepatomegaly</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Umbilical hernia and/or diastasis recti</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
